  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="74327c76-4a74-5e53-8c21-8188af0ac996" activityNameId="3fa25483-35ff-5eec-9d48-56cfac376f9c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Bitumen sealing VA4, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Bitumen sealing VA4, at plant
The dataset is applicable in the construction building sector. Bitumen sealing is used to protect the construction against water intrusion.;
UUID: 91660580-4c03-3aca-b660-3c8f03747cad
The dataset describes the production of bitumen sealing VA4. Included processes are the extrusion of polypropylene foil, the fabrication of the sealing, the infrastructure, the transport by road and rail as well as the disposal of the bitumen cuttings in a municipal incineration. The production of bitumen sealing does not include any chemical processes. In this specific type of bitumen sealing VA4, aluminium is being sputtered onto a PE-foil.
Location: The data of this dataset is taken from literature studies and producer information. 
Technology: Simple processes involved (beside sputtering), a carrier material is being soaked with bitumen. The bitumen coatings are then gritted with minerals (talcum, sand).
Time period: The production of bitumen sealing has not changed very much over the years, as there are no chemical processes involved.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, database 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The used data is mainly valid for Central Europe, the dataset is applicable for the whole European region.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_91660580-4c03-3aca-b660-3c8f03747cad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
